    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "questionText": "Как работает HTTPS и чем он отличается от HTTP?",
    "shortAnswer": "HTTPS = HTTP over TLS: шифрование AES-256-GCM и проверка identity сервера через X.509 сертификат CA. HTTP port 80 plaintext; HTTPS port 443. TLS 1.3 — handshake ~1 RTT.",
    "idealAnswer": "HTTPS оборачивает HTTP в TLS: ECDHE shared secret, AES-256-GCM encrypt, X.509 cert signed by CA proves server identity — защита от MITM. HTTP port 80 plaintext — Wireshark читает tokens. HTTPS 443 — gibberish без keys. TLS 1.3 сократил handshake. When: login, payment, any tokens; public pages SEO+HSTS; static assets — mixed content blocked. Localhost HTTP ok dev. Mistakes: rejectUnauthorized false in prod; HTTP images on HTTPS page blocked; ignore expired cert. HSTS prevents SSL strip downgrade.",
    "maxScore": 10,
    "skills": [
      "javascript"
    ]
